{
  "format": "kshader",
  "generator": "Kekenik Shader",
  "graph": {
    "comments": [
      {
        "color": "#60a5fa",
        "id": "note_inputs",
        "position": {
          "x": 22,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 56,
          "w": 456
        },
        "text": "UV (U around, V along), world normal + view direction for the core, object position / normal for the wobble, time."
      },
      {
        "color": "#4ade80",
        "id": "note_noise",
        "position": {
          "x": 682,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 56,
          "w": 1460
        },
        "text": "`p = (cos θ·r, sin θ·r, v × length − t × speed)` with `θ = 2π·u`: the circle makes the noise continuous around the tube, the third coordinate scrolls it along the beam. 3 octaves of 3D value-fbm give the crackling energy."
      },
      {
        "color": "#fbbf24",
        "id": "note_pulse",
        "position": {
          "x": 682,
          "y": 956
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 2378
        },
        "text": "`pulse = smoothstep(0.7, 1, ½ + ½ sin(2π(v × count − t × speed × 0.5)))` — bright bands that run along the beam."
      },
      {
        "color": "#22d3ee",
        "id": "note_core",
        "position": {
          "x": 3264,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 848
        },
        "text": "`core = (N·V)^sharpness` is 1 where the tube faces the camera. Ends: `smoothstep(0, f, v) × smoothstep(0, f, 1 − v)`."
      },
      {
        "color": "#fb923c",
        "id": "note_mix",
        "position": {
          "x": 4316,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 2378
        },
        "text": "`energy = lerp(1 − noiseAmount, 1, noise)`; brightness = `(energy × (¼ + ¾ core) + pulse × core) × ends × intensity`; colour = `lerp(glow, core colour, core)`."
      },
      {
        "color": "#f472b6",
        "id": "note_vert",
        "position": {
          "x": 4316,
          "y": 865
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 542
        },
        "text": "Wave Deformation along the normal (vertex stage only)."
      },
      {
        "color": "#a78bfa",
        "id": "note_out",
        "position": {
          "x": 6898,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 56,
          "w": 300
        },
        "text": "Additive, ZWrite off, two-sided: set in the graph settings."
      }
    ],
